Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:43.64,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}更似暗影 無蹤無跡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:55.29,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}雪覆屋頂 深陷其間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:03:09.30,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}銀裝素裹 靜待君臨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:20.87,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}高高在上 君臨萬物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:36.91,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}此地永在 其路修遠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.53,0:00:12.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:14.30,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.99,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旅行高興嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:17.62,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:20.70,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗阿姨 下次要跟我約會哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:21.33,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:24.29,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為這次跟說好的不一樣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:27.63,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本來還很期待著跟早苗阿姨一起去旅行的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:30.26,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這傢伙 別糾纏別人的老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.74,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:35.27,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然 約會的時候也會帶上汐 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.15,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.29,0:00:37.92,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那讓我也參加進來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:40.07,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們三人好好玩一玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:41.62,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也 汐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:43.68,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別把我排除在外啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:12.18,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:15.39,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:20.18,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一點也沒變吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:24.90,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這房間還保持著你們結婚時的狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:27.22,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 一點也沒變呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:29.93,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 要帶走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我指那個布偶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:35.13,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐也很喜歡那個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:41.47,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這麼長的時間 真是對不起你們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:42.31,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.76,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直把汐推給你們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:49.17,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能找到身為父親的責任和義務
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:51.80,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也全都是靠了早苗阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:54.37,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我什麼也沒做哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.67,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的把她培養成了一個好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:01:59.70,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都不知道該如何道謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:02.17,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 接下來模仿江川吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:03.65,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}江川
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:08.41,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 接下來我會靠自己來好好撫養她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:12.93,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她培養成和渚一樣既為別人著想 又堅強的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:20.92,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}秋生和我為了渚而換工作 也是在渚五歲的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:22.95,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:26.77,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我會用一生來報答這份恩情的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:30.37,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 就請你們幸福哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:36.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們一定會幸福的 跟汐一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:37.04,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:39.39,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:44.63,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 汐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:46.92,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿秋說打棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:50.54,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.51,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:57.71,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像條死魚一樣的傢伙復活了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:02:59.42,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別廢話了 快投吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:04.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐 好好記住你老爸的醜態哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.09,0:03:05.09,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:07.49,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐認為哪邊會贏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.61,0:03:08.64,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿秋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:09.58,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.51,0:03:13.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那孩子可是看著我的英姿長大的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:16.06,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 看我怎麼打敗你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.18,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可笑至極
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.43,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.55,0:03:29.65,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到了嗎 汐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:35.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又得去道歉了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:34.37,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:37.40,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也沒資格說別人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.65,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從那天起就再也沒哭過
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:44.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真清楚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:48.72,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那當然了 你當我是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:52.17,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為我有了自己的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:55.59,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為我必須要去養育汐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:01.57,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以真太好了 沒有迷失了自我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.54,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五年嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:07.45,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多虧了汐我們才有了寄託呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:10.06,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 沒錯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:13.07,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但這下也終於結束了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:14.77,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.03,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這麼長的時間真是辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:22.71,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪裡 我們是一家人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.57,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.11,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:30.73,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.07,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這次該你好好哭一場了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:34.77,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}秋生…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:37.97,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}覺得撐不下去的時候 還有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:40.97,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你哭完之前 我都會在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:43.53,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 已經可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.10,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 我們就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:17.31,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.60,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路上小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.49,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 去叼了回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:21.06,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:23.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也能聽懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.32,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天開始就要跟爸爸一起住了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:28.73,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要做個乖孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:29.54,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:33.27,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以後我因為工作下班遲了的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:35.59,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幼兒園的接送還得拜託你們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.17,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 全交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:40.20,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也 關於那邊的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:43.74,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:46.89,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打算最近就過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:53.36,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的情況我從古河夫人那裡聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:56.25,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今後還請多多關照了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:58.50,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.17,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 汐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:03.25,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:05.55,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 慢走 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.07,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.81,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 那個人就是岡崎先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:18.85,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直以來都幹什麼去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:22.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是跟古河家發生過什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:23.25,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家庭糾紛？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:26.04,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是以前的我肯定發飆了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:30.88,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 我是岡崎 是岡崎汐的父親
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:32.48,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:33.40,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:38.16,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為一些原因 一直都把女兒託付給了妻子的娘家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:43.18,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從今天起我們就要一起住了 還請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:46.12,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 您太客氣了 我們才是請你多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:50.20,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我家的孩子 跟小汐也很要好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:52.07,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請多多關照了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:53.92,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:55.99,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們要住在一起了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:59.59,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 一直以來勞煩您為我們擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:01.18,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是會很辛苦的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:03.49,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要一個人帶大一個小孩子的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:08.46,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最重要的時期已經由早苗阿姨和大叔代為照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:10.76,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以從今往後無論如何辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:13.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他們的辛苦比起來 都算不了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:16.23,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有什麼困難 隨時可以來找我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:20.22,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公司也會盡力幫忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.84,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 恕我冒昧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:26.40,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:28.46,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐 我來接你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:30.92,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:34.00,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然現在是夏季保育中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:37.43,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是小汐班級的班主任請假了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.42,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請假是因為生病了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:42.15,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她去參加保育士的研修會了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.67,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下週就回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:47.27,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回來後 請重新和她打聲招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:48.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.89,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的老師是個怎麼樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:55.27,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}頭髮長長的 既漂亮又溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:10:00.76,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 爸爸要回去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:04.71,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有外人來了 不可以開門的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:05.28,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.11,0:10:08.95,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什麼事的話就給早苗阿姨打電話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:11.03,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}電話你會打吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:12.08,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:15.10,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我會在天黑前回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:15.83,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:17.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:19.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走好 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:46.82,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:47.72,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:50.56,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兩隻手拿滿了行李 幫我開一下門
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:58.33,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從古河家拿過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:02.06,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}糰子大家族和你的換洗衣服 還有玩具什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.96,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先把這個放好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.69,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放哪裡比較好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.14,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 就放那兒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:25.66,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸會做飯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:28.40,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從現在開始會慢慢去學的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:29.94,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們兩個人一起學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:30.90,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.50,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:39.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公子小姐 好久不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:41.62,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好幾年不見了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這孩子是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.03,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是我的女兒 叫汐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.16,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐 快打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:49.04,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:53.46,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 我叫芳野公子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.19,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這孩子就是小渚的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.87,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:03.30,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也一定能成為像小渚那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:06.78,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既堅強又討人喜歡的女性吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.94,0:12:09.27,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果能這樣就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.68,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她以前是媽媽的老師哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:15.93,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對了 我聽芳野先生說了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:18.25,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您妹妹出院了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.75,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:24.34,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 雖然醫生說這是奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:26.38,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我們一直都堅信著她會醒過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:30.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其實今天是和妹妹一起出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:33.59,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小風
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.22,0:12:44.91,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快打招呼 他們是姐姐的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.35,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就是您的妹妹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.73,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您妹妹真有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:03.81,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小風 沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:06.28,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是姐姐的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.67,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是我妹妹風子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:12.11,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這兩位是岡崎先生和小汐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:13.50,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:15.28,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.84,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:21.36,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:23.80,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太可愛了 我能抱她嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:27.63,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 你一說完就抱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.03,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小風 不能這樣哦 太沒禮貌了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:34.16,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起 她就是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:36.11,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她多大了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:38.52,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和岡崎先生同齡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.21,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是因為一直昏迷著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:45.33,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以她本人的感覺還只是高中一年級
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:48.83,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說 感覺和汐沒多大區別嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:53.06,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 姐姐和岡崎先生太失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:56.37,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生氣了 所以這孩子就是風子的妹妹了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:59.43,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別說莫名其妙的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:01.70,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}趁亂也不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:02.55,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:05.69,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗚 真是太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:11.74,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然有點怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:14.12,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是交到了新朋友真是太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:14.75,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:19.90,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐 爸爸明天也請假了 我們一起出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:21.70,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又去旅行？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:23.82,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:32.31,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也喜歡糰子大家族嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.17,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗說過
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:36.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是媽媽的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:37.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:39.82,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好香
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.77,0:15:00.55,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:18.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:20.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.28,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:33.80,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:36.78,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老了很多啊 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:38.30,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.57,0:15:42.85,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是你的孫女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:46.22,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:48.23,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:53.50,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一直待在家裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.98,0:15:55.72,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:59.64,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我見過你的母親了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.31,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和她一起去旅行的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.08,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那北方的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:09.04,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你以前帶我去過的那個地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:09.97,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:13.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我聽說了很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:16.26,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我覺得你過去很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:19.29,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也想起了很多…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.20,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:28.27,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你累了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:33.01,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多也該休息一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:36.02,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回家鄉去怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:38.35,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的媽媽在那等著你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:43.87,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你牽著我的手 發誓要把我撫養成人的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:47.52,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:51.40,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已經足夠努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.79,0:16:53.97,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 去休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:58.54,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到家鄉去 陪著你的母親一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:16:59.36,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:17.60,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:20.40,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:21.58,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:25.87,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已經 完成了自己的使命了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:42.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是犧牲了自己的一切 養育我到今天了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:46.81,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了我這樣沒出息的兒子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:49.98,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耗費了自己的一生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.54,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:56.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:18:01.82,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不經不覺 我已經完成了自己的使命了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:07.34,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那真是 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:13.68,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.29,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}替換的衣服…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:39.42,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有一點不多的錢 我幫你放進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:41.42,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:44.28,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那邊就由我去聯繫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.09,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在路上別把行李弄丟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.00,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我會小心的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.76,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個家的問題我會想辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.99,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}債務問題也會妥善解決的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:57.48,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:59.16,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐 來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:00.93,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和爺爺說拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:03.16,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜拜了 爺爺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:12.91,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 就此告別了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:15.36,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多注意下身體
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:16.35,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.45,0:19:20.42,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}酒別喝太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:21.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:24.16,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:26.63,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快看 是零食哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:28.82,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}煙也別抽太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:29.99,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:34.70,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸又要出去了 你別吃太多了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:36.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要健康長壽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:39.37,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總是讓你那麼寂寞 抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:42.06,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定會去報恩的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:45.37,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我回來後 好好給你做晚飯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:47.53,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定會去…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:49.28,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們倆一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.35,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好不好 朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:06.41,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.70,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼哭了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:23.10,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起 汐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:25.99,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用擔心我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:30.24,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父親
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:33.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直以來 謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:34.59,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:42.36,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:44.06,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 保重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:46.25,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也 你也多保重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.27,0:20:59.99,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個人的一生是否是幸福的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:04.56,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在最幸福的時候失去了愛人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:08.03,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後只剩下了父子兩人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:12.61,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了我這個不懂得孝順的兒子一直努力著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:16.67,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣的人生 是否是幸福的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:23.50,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父親…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:51.11,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 汐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:53.11,chs for CL汐,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}光…
